While active, you give your flesh and blood body a boost in the form of precisely applied mental forces. Increases Strength and Dexterity by [10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 29% (TL1-5)] of your Willpower and Cunning, respectively.

Strength increased by [10, 17, 22, 27, 30 (TL1-5; CUN 100; WIL 100)]

